D45. This is used in chest development. ~ CEDAR
D47. You must have this to make your mark. ~ AIM
D49. Take this and you'll get all wet. ~ DIP
D51. What office-seekers do. ~ COVET
D53. A night cap. ~ TODDY
D55. What was the writing on the wall? ~ OMEN
D57. This is pretty raw. ~ RARE
